Mr. Chaudhry is no longer a director as of March 10, 2026.</span></p>

<p style="font: 12pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(b)
Mr. Daly served as a director and a member of the Audit Committee until his passing in November 2025.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt">(c) <span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Mr.
Munter was appointed to the Audit Committee on March 24, 2026.</span></p>


